.TH xil-stem-compare 1  "xil-stem-compare " 
.SH NAME
xil\-stem\-compare \- Cross\-reference Whisper transcripts against parsed script dialogue to flag garbled stems.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-stem\-compare\fR [\fB\-s\fR|\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-e\fR|\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-stem\-verify\fR] [\fB\-\-parsed\fR] [\fB\-\-threshold\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-csv\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Cross\-reference Whisper transcripts against parsed script dialogue to flag garbled stems.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-show\fR \fI<SLUG>\fR
Show slug (default: resolved from project.json)
.TP
\fB\-e\fR, \fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Episode tag, e.g. S01E01 (derives both JSON paths if not overridden)
.TP
\fB\-\-stem\-verify\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Path to stem_verify JSON (default: <workspace>/parsed/<slug>/stem_verify_<episode>.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-parsed\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Path to parsed script JSON (default: <workspace>/parsed/<slug>/parsed_<episode>.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-threshold\fR \fI<FLOAT>\fR [default: 0.75]
Similarity below this marks a stem as garbled (default: 0.75)
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write full JSON report to this file (in addition to terminal output)
.TP
\fB\-\-csv\fR
Print flagged entries as CSV to stdout instead of the banner summary
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
